# Docs

- `README`, `ONBOARDING`, `ORKESTRA` each have an `.md` and a `.tr.md`: same sections, commands, order. Change both together.
- Name only commands/flags that exist; `tests/test_docs_drift.py` checks them against the real parser, plus links, anchors and version strings.
- Architecture pages: `docs/architecture.html` (EN), `docs/orkestra-mimari.html` (TR).
- User-visible change: add a line under `## Unreleased` in `CHANGELOG.md` (the release script refuses an empty section).
